---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout title="关于 XTcer - 技术探索者" description="XTcer 是一个专注于前沿技术的内容平台，提供 AI 情报、安全漏洞、云服务优惠等深度技术内容。">
  <main>
    <nav class="nav">
      <div class="nav-inner">
        <a href="/" class="nav-logo">XTcer</a>
        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="/" class="nav-link">首页</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <article class="page">
      <!-- Hero Header -->
      <header class="about-hero">
        <div class="hero-badge">
          <span class="badge-dot"></span>
          关于我们
        </div>
        <h1>
          <span class="title-line">XTcer</span>
          <span class="title-sub">技术探索者</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-desc">eXploring Tech, Delivering Value</p>
      </header>

      <!-- Brand Story -->
      <section class="brand-section">
        <div class="section-icon">🎯</div>
        <h2>品牌含义</h2>
        <div class="brand-card glass-card">
          <div class="brand-name">
            <span class="brand-xt">XT</span>
            <span class="brand-plus">=</span>
            <span class="brand-text">eXploring Tech</span>
          </div>
          <p class="brand-meaning">
            <strong>XT</strong> 代表 <strong>eXploring Tech</strong>（探索技术），<strong>cer</strong> 是"者"的后缀。
          </p>
          <p class="brand-desc">
            XTcer = 技术探索者。我们站在技术前沿，持续追踪 AI、安全、云服务等前沿技术动态，
            为你筛选最有价值的信息，让技术洞察触手可及。
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Mission -->
      <section class="brand-section">
        <div class="section-icon">🚀</div>
        <h2>我们的使命</h2>
        <p>在信息爆炸的时代，我们相信<strong>高质量的技术洞察</strong>应该是简洁、高效、易于获取的。</p>
        <p>XTcer 致力于：</p>
        <ul class="mission-list">
          <li>
            <span class="mission-icon">🔍</span>
            <div>
              <strong>深度探索</strong>
              <span>深入挖掘 AI、安全、云服务等领域的前沿动态</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="mission-icon">⚡</span>
            <div>
              <strong>极速传递</strong>
              <span>第一时间推送安全漏洞、AI 新进展等关键信息</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="mission-icon">💎</span>
            <div>
              <strong>价值筛选</strong>
              <span>从海量信息中筛选出真正有价值的内容</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="mission-icon">🌐</span>
            <div>
              <strong>全球视野</strong>
              <span>覆盖全球技术生态，提供国际化视角</span>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Content Areas -->
      <section class="brand-section">
        <div class="section-icon">📡</div>
        <h2>内容领域</h2>
        <div class="content-grid">
          <div class="content-card glass-card">
            <div class="content-icon">🤖</div>
            <h3>AI 情报</h3>
            <p>追踪 AI 领域最新进展、工具发布、商业应用，把握人工智能发展脉搏</p>
          </div>
          <div class="content-card glass-card">
            <div class="content-icon">🔒</div>
            <h3>安全漏洞</h3>
            <p>实时监控安全漏洞动态，第一时间推送关键安全信息，守护数字资产</p>
          </div>
          <div class="content-card glass-card">
            <div class="content-icon">☁️</div>
            <h3>云服务优惠</h3>
            <p>精选各大云服务商优惠信息，帮你节省成本，优化资源配置</p>
          </div>
          <div class="content-card glass-card">
            <div class="content-icon">📝</div>
            <h3>技术深度</h3>
            <p>原创技术文章、最佳实践、架构设计，提升技术深度和广度</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Tech Stack -->
      <section class="brand-section">
        <div class="section-icon">⚙️</div>
        <h2>技术架构</h2>
        <p>XTcer 使用现代化技术栈构建，追求极致性能和用户体验：</p>
        <div class="tech-grid">
          <div class="tech-item">
            <span class="tech-badge">Astro</span>
            <span class="tech-desc">极速静态站点生成器</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tech-item">
            <span class="tech-badge">Supabase</span>
            <span class="tech-desc">开源实时数据库</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tech-item">
            <span class="tech-badge">Cloudflare</span>
            <span class="tech-desc">全球边缘网络加速</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tech-item">
            <span class="tech-badge">TypeScript</span>
            <span class="tech-desc">类型安全的 JavaScript</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-highlight glass-card">
          <h4>为什么选择轻量方案？</h4>
          <p>传统 CMS 往往臃肿缓慢。XTcer 采用轻量级架构，打包体积仅为传统方案的 1/10，实现：</p>
          <ul>
            <li>⚡ 极速页面加载（全球 CDN &lt;100ms）</li>
            <li>🎯 更好的用户体验和 SEO 表现</li>
            <li>💰 更低的运营成本（免费部署）</li>
            <li>🔒 更高的安全性（无数据库暴露）</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Slogan -->
      <section class="brand-section slogan-section">
        <div class="slogan-card glass-card">
          <blockquote>
            "探索前沿，洞见未来"
          </blockquote>
          <p>站在技术前沿，为你筛选最有价值的信息</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Contact -->
      <section class="brand-section">
        <div class="section-icon">💬</div>
        <h2>联系我们</h2>
        <p>如果您有任何问题、建议或合作意向，欢迎通过以下方式联系我们：</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="contact-btn glass-btn-primary">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg>
          联系我们
        </a>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page { 
    max-width: 800px; 
    margin: 0 auto; 
    padding: 2rem 0 4rem; 
  }
  
  /* About Hero */
  .about-hero {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 4rem 0 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  
  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.375rem 1rem;
    background: rgba(41,151,255,0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(41,151,255,0.15);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  
  .badge-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background: var(--primary);
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: pulse 2s infinite;
  }
  
  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
    50% { opacity: 0.5; transform: scale(0.8); }
  }
  
  .about-hero h1 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .title-line {
    display: block;
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2997ff 0%, #bf5af2 50%, #00ffff 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
    background-size: 200% 200%;
    animation: gradientShift 3s ease infinite;
  }
  
  @keyframes gradientShift {
    0%, 100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
    50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
  }
  
  .title-sub {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }
  
  .hero-desc {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
  }
  
  /* Brand Sections */
  .brand-section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  .section-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .brand-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  
  .brand-section p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .brand-section strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  
  /* Brand Card */
  .brand-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  
  .brand-name {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  
  .brand-xt {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2997ff, #bf5af2);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }
  
  .brand-plus {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  
  .brand-text {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  
  .brand-meaning {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .brand-desc {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  
  /* Mission List */
  .mission-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }
  
  .mission-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--surface);
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }
  
  .mission-list li:hover {
    background: var(--surface-hover);
    border-color: var(--glass-border-hover);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }
  
  .mission-icon {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.125rem;
  }
  
  .mission-list strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  
  .mission-list span {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  
  /* Content Grid */
  .content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  
  .content-card {
    padding: 1.25rem;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }
  
  .content-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  
  .content-icon {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .content-card h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  
  .content-card p {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }
  
  /* Tech Grid */
  .tech-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }
  
  .tech-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    background: var(--surface);
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
  }
  
  .tech-badge {
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    background: rgba(41,151,255,0.1);
    color: var(--primary);
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  
  .tech-desc {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  
  .tech-highlight {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  
  .tech-highlight h4 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  
  .tech-highlight p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .tech-highlight ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  
  .tech-highlight li {
    padding: 0.375rem 0;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  
  /* Slogan Section */
  .slogan-section {
    margin: 3rem 0;
  }
  
  .slogan-card {
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(41,151,255,0.05), rgba(191,90,242,0.05));
  }
  
  .slogan-card blockquote {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  
  .slogan-card p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }
  
  /* Contact Button */
  .contact-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2997ff, #0077ed);
    color: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  
  .contact-btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(41,151,255,0.3);
    color: white;
  }
  
  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about-hero {
      padding: 2rem 0;
    }
    
    .title-line {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }
    
    .title-sub {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
    }
    
    .content-grid,
    .tech-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    
    .brand-name {
      justify-content: center;
    }
    
    .mission-list li {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
